&lt;p&gt;源码 &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/lizheming/issues-translate-action&#34;&gt;https://github.com/lizheming/issues-translate-action&lt;/a&gt; 基于 &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/dromara/issues-translate-action&#34;&gt;https://github.com/dromara/issues-translate-action&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
